##     only publishes binaries up to clang-format 16, so the binary is taken
##     from the "clang-format" PyPI wheels published by the pybind11 project,
##     which repackage the official LLVM release binaries.
##   - The script lives in QMOMKit's tools/ directory instead of deal.II's
